{
  "id": "dath_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "Dath does not rise. \"You want the Deep Gate. Everybody who comes to this hall wants the Deep Gate.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "text": "We want the Deep Gate.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "the_fee"
        },
        {
          "id": "why_shut",
          "text": "Why has it never been opened?",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "why_shut"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [
        {
          "requires": {
            "memories": [
              {
                "deedKind": "deep_door_opened",
                "who": "speaker"
              }
            ]
          },
          "goto": "he_has_heard"
        },
        {
          "requires": {
            "factions": [
              {
                "faction": "karn_dolur",
                "minRank": "hold_friend"
              }
            ]
          },
          "goto": "hold_friend"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "why_shut",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Because it was shut.\" He turns a page. \"That is the whole of the reasoning and it has held for nine hundred years. Every generation that has asked for a better one has been shown the ledger and has gone away.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "text": "Hm.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "the_fee",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Twenty to go down. The hold would rather you did not, and charges accordingly.\" He does not look up. \"You may also earn it, which is slower and which I would respect more.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "pay",
          "text": "We'll pay.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "setFlag": {
                "flag": "down_by_karn_dolur",
                "value": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "greet"
        },
        {
          "id": "earn",
          "text": "How is it earned?",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": true,
          "lockedHint": "The hold does not know you well enough to have that conversation.",
          "goto": "earned",
          "requires": {
            "factions": [
              {
                "faction": "karn_dolur",
                "minStanding": 15
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "earned",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"By having been useful to the hold, which the ledger says you have been.\" He writes something. \"Warrant's yours. Do not make me regret the entry.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "thanks",
          "text": "We won't.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "setFlag": {
            "flag": "down_by_karn_dolur",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "karn_dolur",
            "amount": 10
          }
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": [],
      "remembers": "hold_honoured"
    },
    {
      "id": "hold_friend",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Hold-friend,\" says Dath, and closes the ledger, which is the single most surprising thing that has happened to you in Aurendel. \"Say what you need.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "the_gate",
          "text": "The Deep Gate.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "earned"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "Only passing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "he_has_heard",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "The ledger is already open at a page with your name on it. \"You opened a door of ours,\" says Dath. \"I have written it down. That is all I intend to do about it, and it is more than you think.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "...",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    }
  ]
}
